msgid "<strong>IMPORTANT NOTE:</strong> To use the Avada PWA feature you need to install and activate the latest version of the PWA plugin. Please <a href=\"%s\">visit the Avada Plugins page</a> to install and activate the plugin and then refresh Global Options to edit the options."
